t Day, is Hell - that Day, man will remember, but how [i.e., what good] to him will be the remembrance?","w":[{"ar":"وَجِا۟ىٓءَ","tr":"wajīa","en":"And is brought","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۭ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"that Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"بِجَهَنَّمَ ۚ","tr":"bijahannama","en":"Hell"},{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"That Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","tr":"yatadhakkaru","en":"will remember","root":"ذكر","lem":"تَذَكَّرَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","tr":"l-insānu","en":"man","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنسان"},{"ar":"وَأَنَّىٰ","tr":"wa-annā","en":"but how"},{"ar":"لَهُ","tr":"lahu","en":"(will be) for him"},{"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ","tr":"l-dhik'rā","en":"the remembrance","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذِكْرَى"}]},{"n":24,"juz":30,"ar":"يَقُولُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى قَدَّمْتُ لِحَيَاتِى","en":"He will say, \"Oh, I wish I had sent ahead [some good] for my life.\"","w":[{"ar":"يَقُولُ","tr":"yaqūlu","en":"He will say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"يَـٰلَيْتَنِى","tr":"yālaytanī","en":"O I wish"},{"ar":"قَدَّمْتُ","tr":"qaddamtu","en":"I had sent forth","root":"قدم","lem":"قَدَّمَ"},{"ar":"لِحَيَاتِى","tr":"liḥayātī","en":"for my life","root":"حيي","lem":"حَياة"}]},{"n":25,"juz":30,"ar":"فَيَوْمَئِذٍ لَّا يُعَذِّبُ عَذَابَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ","en":"So on that Day, none will punish [as severely] as His punishment,","w":[{"ar":"فَيَوْمَئِذٍۢ","tr":"fayawma-idhin","en":"So that Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"لَّا","tr":"lā","en":"not"},{"ar":"يُعَذِّبُ","tr":"yuʿadhibu","en":"will punish","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"عَذَابَهُۥٓ","tr":"ʿadhābahu","en":"(as) His punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"أَحَدٌۭ","tr":"aḥadun","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":26,"juz":30,"ar":"وَلَا يُوثِقُ وَثَاقَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ","en":"And none will bind [as severely] as His binding [of the evildoers].","w":[{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"يُوثِقُ","tr":"yūthiqu","en":"will bind","root":"وثق","lem":"يُو